WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.976
"Sara!" Tor cried.

2
00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:14.348
"Our tic-tac-toe game!"

3
00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:17.619
"Sorry!" Sara said.

4
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.558
"I didn't mean to splash your game."

5
00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:27.220
Tor sighed. "That's okay."

6
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:31.957
"I got wet too," Sid said.

7
00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:37.556
"But the water feels good.

8
00:00:37.557 --> 00:00:40.187
It's hot today!"

9
00:00:40.188 --> 00:00:44.842
Sid got up.

10
00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:46.560
Splash!

11
00:00:46.561 --> 00:00:50.780
Sid jumped into the stream.

12
00:00:50.781 --> 00:00:55.703
"I'm going to swim too!" Tor said.

13
00:00:55.704 --> 00:00:57.222
Splash!

14
00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:02.622
Tor jumped in.

15
00:01:02.623 --> 00:01:12.203
The buddies splashed and played.

16
00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:18.569
Rex did a flip.

17
00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.234
Sid splashed with his tail.

18
00:01:22.235 --> 00:01:32.376
Sara held her breath under water.

19
00:01:32.377 --> 00:01:35.497
Tor saw a shiny rock.

20
00:01:35.498 --> 00:01:41.424
"Ooh!" She reached for it.

21
00:01:41.425 --> 00:01:44.818
Suddenly a fish swam by.

22
00:01:44.819 --> 00:01:49.447
"A fish!" Tor dived after it.

23
00:01:49.448 --> 00:01:52.727
The fish moved fast.

24
00:01:52.728 --> 00:01:55.982
Tor chased it.

25
00:01:55.983 --> 00:02:02.756
But now the stream moved fast too.

26
00:02:02.757 --> 00:02:05.623
Tor tried to stop.

27
00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:09.847
But the stream was pulling her away!

28
00:02:09.848 --> 00:02:15.740
Tor gulped. "Help!"

